{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca3fbdd572eee5207727692a1783e50d6c416da72f74b40150f014f2621ae3e4", "ja": "（伊織とエミリーのデュオ活動が絶好調だ。\n今日のミニライブも盛況だったな……）", "zh": "（伊织和艾米莉的双人活动进展得非常顺利。今天的迷你演唱会也很成功……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "4a9491c1323942423483bdf2d5bffaaed6c9dc799d9fb252552363ffc952d661", "ja": "{$P$}、何をぼーっとしてるのよ。\n私、もう出かけたいんだけど。", "zh": "{$P$}，你在发什么呆啊。我已经想出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d812d91363b65c65ce64a4b62916084a818c424896429115e7e44c4fc7a669fc", "ja": "あれ？　伊織、\n大きなトランクなんか用意してどうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？伊织，\n你怎么准备了这么大的旅行箱啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "f4d31efbe08312b80270c228d37efed5c4e2886135c5287ffef4b9c44d80f30c", "ja": "最近、すごく調子も気分もいいから、\nこの勢いに乗って、旅に行きたいの。", "zh": "最近状态和心情都特别好，\n想趁着这股劲儿去旅行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5da552835a4d571e15d6a978777ae02da28ada0a611dd591523f2222fb193e9d", "ja": "旅って、どこへ……。", "zh": "旅行是要去哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "245769bcb0f44d78cb4c101951fc573733be74ef3f970d21e5d689a8f1568ce7", "ja": "世界中よ！　ワールドツアー！\nもちろん、エミリーも一緒にね♪", "zh": "全世界哦！环球巡演！\n当然也要和艾米莉一起去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "33b38f003aaccd36e1f5a43291413c1da85bddf29a30b01e1a5617b81b195c2f", "ja": "ふふっ。きっと世界中に、私達が歌いに来るのを\n待ってる人がいるわ。地球の裏側にだって……。", "zh": "呵呵，我想世界各地一定都有等待着我们去唱歌的人。哪怕是在地球的另一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5271fcb00430bdf94dbbe3ecd5309ceac04eccb841d8329bb6a0d1760b4d835a", "ja": "いやいやいや、待ってくれ。地球の裏側まで\n行くような仕事の予定は、今のところないよ。", "zh": "不不不，等等。目前还没有要去到\n地球另一端那么远的工作安排哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "ca24787fcf39ae11fe9278d646644de13b41eaff7866c0f14437ec99c1101a45", "ja": "え、ないの？　でも、アンタならできるでしょ？\n今すぐなんとかなさいよ。", "zh": "咦，没有吗？不过，这种事你应该能做到吧？\n现在马上想想办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "84fc2ee5d27c18199993e6c75d8d8cab3c5632578da8ecba3f6c58e10e295492", "ja": "無茶言うなあ。……でもデュオが好調な今、\nもっと頑張りたい伊織の気持ちはわかるよ。", "zh": "别说这种强人所难的话啊。……不过，趁现在二重唱状态正好，我也明白伊织想更加努力的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "ae0011bfbcc47970e26dbee90465f5d0140eb570e3a036774d2aeb2057945f39", "ja": "でしょ？　もったいないじゃない。この\n伊織ちゃんの魅力を世界に届けられないなんて♪", "zh": "对吧？这不是太可惜了吗？居然没法把我伊织的魅力传遍全世界♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "c5b7bb129f95464629db6a3a591437c5ca6856497348ef7294f008bbcf4cf16e", "ja": "それに……エミリーにももっと、広い世界で\n活躍してもらえたら、って思うし……。", "zh": "而且……我也希望艾米莉能在更广阔的世界大放异彩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "05aa8b0e523c4a47ce352ca47e5f8ab3fcd56d77dba93a1e959645dad2c6b451", "ja": "わかった、検討しよう。ワールドツアーか……\nさしあたって伊織、最初はどこに行きたいんだ？", "zh": "我知道了，我会考虑的。世界巡演吗……\n伊织，首先来说，你最想先去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "845fa0926286d192b0c3c9857ecff91db5cf75199c40fce4432e457f7118894e", "ja": "どこって……そうね。うーん……。\n別に、どこでもいいわ。決めてないから。", "zh": "去哪里……这个嘛，嗯……  \n其实去哪儿都行。我还没决定呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "8731c77c4d87e082ebff33b14d7efa5aa0dded9f9f50b30989aceb4da2a92035", "ja": "すぐには出かけられなくても、旅の準備を\nあれこれ考えるのも案外、面白いし……。", "zh": "就算没法马上出发，光是想想旅行要准备些什么，也意外地挺有意思的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "4edd6ce29fea5b740b5f24acc13b15befc69e9534bcdef23364d12fc3029bb55", "ja": "それに、どこに行くかよりも、誰と何をするかよ。\n一緒にいる相手が楽しければ、どんな旅でもね。", "zh": "而且，比起去哪里，更重要的是和谁一起做什么。\n只要同行的人开心，不管是什么样的旅行都一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "de729928040f1e7dadcd175b3d5ce387ef7eab825cc70f2a9f03659bcfa2f6d4", "ja": "そうか……。まあ、すぐに出発ってわけじゃ\nないけど、楽しいツアーになりそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊……不过也不是马上就要出发，看来会是一次愉快的巡演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "7db47c1447830849373c58149d0cfadefb4effdbcd867a1e714b8828de5d32b1", "ja": "当然よ！　絶対、最高の旅になるんだから！", "zh": "那当然了！绝对会是一场最棒的旅行的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1019_p", "source_sha256": "890a132b6e3fdf362320168dc740597eea4fc075d220ce714002de56b4d9994d", "ja": "よし。旅行のガイドは引き受けた。\nツアーのプロデュースは、まかせてくれ。", "zh": "好。旅行向导的工作我接下了。\n巡回的制作就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0173_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "0a4747b668763cb206849a81ba6ce61af9966e9ded7d6befae506bd1b8769ef1", "ja": "ええ！　旅先でもキッチリ働きなさい！\n頼りにしてるわよ？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "没错！到了旅行目的地也要好好工作！\n我可指望你了哦？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
